原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_reading_cases":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:source_review28-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"9eh_cjt_i63","source_quote":"宋末，扶南王姓僑陳如，名闍耶跋摩，遣商貨至廣州。天竺道人那伽仙附載欲歸國，遭風至林邑，掠其財物皆盡。那伽仙閒道得達扶南，具說中國有聖主受命。","reading":"扶南王闍耶跋摩遣商貨至廣州。那伽仙的海路、返國及言中國受命另有主語。","note":"扶南王闍耶跋摩遣商貨至廣州。那伽仙的海路、返國及言中國受命另有主語。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p028","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":70,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete-ws2638629"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:source_review30-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"9eh_cjt_i63","source_quote":"那伽仙詣京師，言其國俗事摩䤈首羅天神，神常降於摩躭山。土氣恒暖，草木不落。其上書曰：「吉祥利世閒，感攝於羣生。所以其然者，天感化緣明。仙山名摩躭，吉樹敷嘉榮。摩䤈首羅天，依此降尊靈。國土悉蒙祐，人民皆安寧。由斯恩被故，是以臣歸情。菩薩行忍慈，本迹起凡基。一發菩提心，二乘非所期。歷生積功業，六度行大悲。勇猛超劫數，財命捨無遺。生死不為猒，六道化有緣。具脩於十地，遺果度人天。功業既已定，行滿登正覺。萬善智圓備，惠日照塵俗。眾生感緣應，隨機授法藥。佛化遍十方，無不蒙濟擢。皇帝聖弘道，興隆於三寶。垂心覽萬機，威恩振八表。國土及城邑，仁風化清皎。亦如釋提洹，眾天中最超。陛下臨萬民，四海共歸心，聖慈流無疆，被臣小國深。」詔報曰：「具摩䤈降靈，流施彼土，雖殊俗異化，遙深欣讚。知鳩酬羅於彼背叛，竊據林邑，聚兇肆掠，殊宜剪討。彼雖介遐（休）〔陬〕，舊脩蕃貢，自宋季多難，海譯致壅，皇化惟新，習迷未革。朕方以文德來遠人，未欲便興干戈。王既欵列忠到，遠請軍威，今詔交部隨宜應接。伐叛柔服，寔惟國典，勉立殊效，以副所期。那伽仙屢銜邊譯，頗悉中土闊狹，令其具宣。」上報以絳紫地黃碧綠紋綾各五匹。","reading":"那伽仙到京師敘國俗與上書，詔末明付使者傳宣。扶南王及詔書各審發言人。","note":"那伽仙到京師敘國俗與上書，詔末明付使者傳宣。扶南王及詔書各審發言人。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p030","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":489,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete-ws2638629"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:variant_review28-24","kind":"variant_review","person_id":"9eh_cjt_i63","source_quote":"天竺道人那伽仙","reading":"先遭風至林邑，後到扶南又受命出使。扶南王闍耶跋摩的表始另有主語。","note":"先遭風至林邑，後到扶南又受命出使。扶南王闍耶跋摩的表始另有主語。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p028","start_codepoint":24,"end_codepoint":31,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete-ws2638629"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:variant_review30-453","kind":"variant_review","person_id":"9eh_cjt_i63","source_quote":"那伽仙屢銜邊譯","reading":"帝詔末段確指使者，前段回扶南國王所請不同。","note":"帝詔末段確指使者，前段回扶南國王所請不同。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p030","start_codepoint":453,"end_codepoint":460,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete-ws2638629"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p028:m0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"那伽仙","kind":"person","person_id":"9eh_cjt_i63","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p028","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p028:m0050","start":50,"end":53,"surface":"那伽仙","kind":"person","person_id":"9eh_cjt_i63","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p028","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p029:m0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"那伽仙","kind":"person","person_id":"9eh_cjt_i63","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p029","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p029:m0180","start":180,"end":183,"surface":"那伽仙","kind":"person","person_id":"9eh_cjt_i63","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p029","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p029:m0211","start":211,"end":214,"surface":"那伽仙","kind":"person","person_id":"9eh_cjt_i63","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p029","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p029:m0349","start":349,"end":352,"surface":"那伽仙","kind":"person","person_id":"9eh_cjt_i63","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p029","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p029:m0709","start":709,"end":712,"surface":"那伽仙","kind":"person","person_id":"9eh_cjt_i63","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p029","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p030:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"那伽仙","kind":"person","person_id":"9eh_cjt_i63","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p030","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p030:m0453","start":453,"end":456,"surface":"那伽仙","kind":"person","person_id":"9eh_cjt_i63","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p030","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p028","text":"宋末，扶南王姓僑陳如，名闍耶跋摩，遣商貨至廣州。天竺道人那伽仙附載欲歸國，遭風至林邑，掠其財物皆盡。那伽仙閒道得達扶南，具說中國有聖主受命。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":74,"last_line":74,"raw_start":5360,"raw_end":5430,"raw_character_offsets":[5360,5361,5362,5363,5364,5365,5366,5367,5368,5369,5370,5371,5372,5373,5374,5375,5376,5377,5378,5379,5380,5381,5382,5383,5384,5385,5386,5387,5388,5389,5390,5391,5392,5393,5394,5395,5396,5397,5398,5399,5400,5401,5402,5403,5404,5405,5406,5407,5408,5409,5410,5411,5412,5413,5414,5415,5416,5417,5418,5419,5420,5421,5422,5423,5424,5425,5426,5427,5428,5429],"revision_id":2638629},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p028:m0012","start":12,"end":16,"surface":"闍耶跋摩","kind":"person","person_id":"xfy_0t0_umc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p028:m0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"那伽仙","kind":"person","person_id":"9eh_cjt_i63","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p028:m0050","start":50,"end":53,"surface":"那伽仙","kind":"person","person_id":"9eh_cjt_i63","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-058","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete-ws2638629"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p029","text":"永明二年，闍耶跋摩遣天竺道人釋那伽仙上表稱扶南國王臣僑陳如闍耶跋摩叩頭啟曰：「天化撫育，感動靈祇，四氣調適。伏願聖主尊體起居康（御）〔豫〕，皇太子萬福，六宮清休，諸王妃主內外朝臣普同和睦，隣境士庶萬國歸心，五穀豐熟，災害不生，土清民泰，一切安穩。臣及人民，國土豐樂，四氣調和，道俗濟濟，竝蒙陛下光化所被，咸荷安泰。」又曰：「臣前遣使齎雜物行廣州貨易，天竺道人釋那伽仙於廣州因附臣舶欲來扶南，海中風漂到林邑，國王奪臣貨易，并那伽仙私財。具陳其從中國來此，仰序陛下聖德仁治，詳議風化，佛法興顯，眾僧殷集，法事日盛，王威嚴整，朝望國軌，慈愍蒼生，八方六合，莫不歸伏。如聽其所說，則化隣諸天，非可為喻。臣聞之，下情踊悅，若蹔奉見尊足，仰慕慈恩，澤流小國，天垂所感，率土之民，竝得皆蒙恩祐。是以臣今遣此道人釋那伽仙為使，上表問訊奉貢，微獻呈臣等赤心，并別陳下情。但所獻輕陋，愧懼唯深。伏願天慈曲照，鑒其丹款，賜不垂責。」又曰：「臣有奴名鳩酬羅，委臣（免）〔逸〕走，別在餘處，構結兇逆，遂破林邑，仍自立為王。永不恭從，違恩負義，叛主之諐，天不容載。伏尋林邑昔為檀和之所破，久已歸化。天威所被，四海彌伏，而今鳩酬羅守執奴兇，自專很彊。且林邑扶南隣界相接，親又是臣奴，猶尚逆去，朝廷遙遠，豈復遵奉。此國屬陛下，故謹具上啟。伏聞林邑頃年表獻簡絕，便欲永隔朝廷，豈有師子坐而安大鼠。伏願遣軍將伐兇逆，臣亦自効微誠，助朝廷剪撲，使邊海諸國，一時歸伏。陛下若欲別立餘人為彼王者，伏聽勑旨。脫未欲灼然興兵伐林邑者，伏願特賜勑在所，隨宜以少軍助臣，乘天之威，殄滅小賊，伐惡從善。平蕩之日，上表獻金五婆羅。今輕此使送臣丹誠，表所陳啟，不盡下情。謹附那伽仙并其伴口具啟聞。伏願愍所啟。并獻金鏤龍王坐像一軀，白檀像一軀，牙塔二軀，古貝二雙，瑠璃蘇鉝二口，瑇瑁檳榔柈一枚。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":76,"last_line":76,"raw_start":5432,"raw_end":6300,"raw_character_offsets":[5432,5433,5434,5435,5436,5437,5438,5439,5440,5441,5442,5443,5444,5445,5446,5447,5448,5449,5450,5451,5452,5453,5454,5455,5456,5457,5458,5459,5460,5461,5462,5463,5464,5465,5466,5467,5468,5469,5470,5471,5472,5473,5474,5475,5476,5477,5478,5479,5480,5481,5482,5483,5484,5485,5486,5487,5488,5489,5490,5491,5492,5493,5494,5495,5496,5497,5498,5499,5500,5501,5535,5536,5537,5538,5539,5540,5541,5542,5543,5544,5545,5546,5547,5548,5549,5550,5551,5552,5553,5554,5555,5556,5557,5558,5559,5560,5561,5562,5563,5564,5565,5566,5567,5568,5569,5570,5571,5572,5573,5574,5575,5576,5577,5578,5579,5580,5581,5582,5583,5584,5585,5586,5587,5588,5589,5590,5591,5592,5593,5594,5595,5596,5597,5598,5599,5600,5601,5602,5603,5604,5605,5606,5607,5608,5609,5610,5611,5612,5613,5614,5615,5616,5617,5618,5619,5620,5621,5622,5623,5624,5625,5626,5627,5628,5629,5630,5631,5632,5633,5634,5635,5636,5637,5638,5639,5640,5641,5642,5643,5644,5645,5646,5647,5648,5649,5650,5651,5652,5653,5654,5655,5656,5657,5658,5659,5660,5661,5662,5663,5664,5665,5666,5667,5668,5669,5670,5671,5672,5673,5674,5675,5676,5677,5678,5679,5680,5681,5682,5683,5684,5685,5686,5687,5688,5689,5690,5691,5692,5693,5694,5695,5696,5697,5698,5699,5700,5701,5702,5703,5704,5705,5706,5707,5708,5709,5710,5711,5712,5713,5714,5715,5716,5717,5718,5719,5720,5721,5722,5723,5724,5725,5726,5727,5728,5729,5730,5731,5732,5733,5734,5735,5736,5737,5738,5739,5740,5741,5742,5743,5744,5745,5746,5747,5748,5749,5750,5751,5752,5753,5754,5755,5756,5757,5758,5759,5760,5761,5762,5763,5764,5765,5766,5767,5768,5769,5770,5771,5772,5773,5774,5775,5776,5777,5778,5779,5780,5781,5782,5783,5784,5785,5786